# REQUIRES: msil-registered-target, x86-registered-target
## Check that MSIL methods are found and labeled by their '.method' header,
## and that x86 checks in the same file keep their plain labels.
## lit finds no 'llc' binary on Windows (llc.exe), so this directory is
## UNSUPPORTED there; msil/utils/run-utc-tests.py runs this test instead.

# RUN: cp -f %S/Inputs/msil-basic.ll %t.ll && %update_llc_test_checks %t.ll
# RUN: diff -u %S/Inputs/msil-basic.ll.expected %t.ll
